WEBVTT

00:06:55.316 --> 00:07:00.796
But the living insight that you and I,

00:07:00.796 --> 00:07:04.276
we are much more than we think.

00:07:05.236 --> 00:07:09.676
And this is an immense source
of love and strength

00:07:09.716 --> 00:07:14.236
as we take action in the here and now.

00:07:15.316 --> 00:07:18.196
Which brings us to question number two.

00:07:20.116 --> 00:07:21.716
Where are you?

00:07:24.316 --> 00:07:25.596
Are you here?

00:07:26.756 --> 00:07:27.916
Are you now?

00:07:28.676 --> 00:07:34.196
Do you feel at home in yourself,
relaxed and at ease?